{"product_id":"velo-nicotine-pouches-icy-berries","title":"VELO Nicotine Pouches - Icy Berries","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience the fusion of the seasons in VELO Icy Berries. Taste the raspberry, blueberry and blackberries flavours of the summer and feel how it melts together with the cooling fresh mint and menthol harshness flavours of the cold winter air. We call it a “fused reality”. In Slim format \u0026amp; middle nicotine intensity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVelo nicotine pouches are great for satisfying cravings in places where you can’t smoke or vape, such as on public transport, at an airport or even in a restaurant. Available in a 8mg strength per pouch, they’re perfect if you have some experience with using pouches and are looking for something in a medium level.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e8mg Strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease note:\u003c\/strong\u003e Do not chew, suck or swallow these pouches – they’re only designed to be placed behind your top lip.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41990788153399,"sku":"VELO - Icy Berries","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/velo-icy-berries-nicotine-pouch.webp?v=1763407712","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/velo-nicotine-pouches-icy-berries","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




